n the above table is adjusted quarterly based upon the passage of time or the anticipated success or failure of achieving certain milestones. The change in fair value of contingent consideration of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="i977549e4ba3e4362ae3e05327fbde31a_D20230101-20230331" decimals="-5" name="kprx:ChangesInFairValueOfContingentConsideration" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="6" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOjk2ZjljNTIyYjY1NDQ4M2E4NjA5NTViNDY3ZDQ2ZGE5L3NlYzo5NmY5YzUyMmI2NTQ0ODNhODYwOTU1YjQ2N2Q0NmRhOV80My9mcmFnOmQ0OWYxYWFhNTUyYTQ2OGFhNWJlNjIwY2Y4OTc2NDJjL3RleHRyZWdpb246ZDQ5ZjFhYWE1NTJhNDY4YWE1YmU2MjBjZjg5NzY0MmNfNTQ5NzU1ODIwNTI5_68c719f9-7c7d-4d2e-8525-a1feab1b720a">0.2</ix:nonFraction> million for the three months ended March&#160;31, 2023, was primarily driven by a decreased </span></div></ix:continuation><div style="height:45pt;position:relative;width:100%"><div style="bottom:0;position:absolute;width:100%"><div style="text-align:center"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">11</span></div></div></div><hr style="page-break-after:always"/><div style="min-height:72pt;width:100%"><div><span style="color:#0000ff;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;text-decoration:underline"><a style="color:#0000ff;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;text-decoration:underline" href="#i96f9c522b654483a860955b467d46da9_7">Table of Contents</a></span></div><div style="text-align:center"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">KIORA PHARMACEUTICALS, INC.</span></div><div style="text-align:center"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">NOTES TO CONDENSED CONSOLIDATED FINANCIAL STATEMENTS (unaudited)</span></div><div style="text-align:center"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">March&#160;31, 2023</span></div></div><div style="margin-top:12pt;text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"><ix:continuation id="id5f9348abd1244ef8fb4f34cea64fbd8">discount rate. The change in fair value of contingent consideration of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="i48c52084df4a4ba082c48bfddd3f9f94_D20220101-20220331" decimals="-5" name="kprx:ChangesInFairValueOfContingentConsideration" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="6" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOjk2ZjljNTIyYjY1NDQ4M2E4NjA5NTViNDY3ZDQ2ZGE5L3NlYzo5NmY5YzUyMmI2NTQ0ODNhODYwOTU1YjQ2N2Q0NmRhOV80My9mcmFnOmQ0OWYxYWFhNTUyYTQ2OGFhNWJlNjIwY2Y4OTc2NDJjL3RleHRyZWdpb246ZDQ5ZjFhYWE1NTJhNDY4YWE1YmU2MjBjZjg5NzY0MmNfNTQ5NzU1ODIwODg3_82e393eb-101e-4b80-b264-a801a0e47f33">0.2</ix:nonFraction> million for the three months ended March&#160;31, 2022 was primarily driven by changes in estimated probabilities of success related to the orphan drug status designation of the Bayon drug candidate which occurred in March 2022. The change in fair value of contingent consideration is recorded within operating expenses on the accompanying condensed consolidated statements of operation and comprehensive loss.</ix:continuation></span></div><div id="i96f9c522b654483a860955b467d46da9_46"></div><div style="margin-top:12pt;text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">4. <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="i977549e4ba3e4362ae3e05327fbde31a_D20230101-20230331" name="us-gaap:StockholdersEquityNoteDisclosureTextBlock" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOjk2ZjljNTIyYjY1NDQ4M2E4NjA5NTViNDY3ZDQ2ZGE5L3NlYzo5NmY5YzUyMmI2NTQ0ODNhODYwOTU1YjQ2N2Q0NmRhOV80Ni9mcmFnOmU1MTNiMWIxOTdlZDQ2Yzc5YmU3ZWQ3MzRmNzg4ODgxL3RleHRyZWdpb246ZTUxM2IxYjE5N2VkNDZjNzliZTdlZDczNGY3ODg4ODFfMzczNA_dc45504a-52be-48cf-a468-a419f06b2eb0" continuedAt="i7dc37ba80bd04970a4e03c1639699927" escape="true">Capital Stock</ix:nonNumeric></span></div><ix:continuation id="i7dc37ba80bd04970a4e03c1639699927" continuedAt="ie621b3020f0045689c937efa5926ab3d"><div style="margin-top:12pt;text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">In connection with the Company&#8217;s acquisition of Panoptes Pharma GmbH (&#8220;Panoptes&#8221;) in December 2020, on June&#160;18, 2022, the Company issued an aggregate of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="shares" contextRef="i5fb6fb908d714d4491a7d391c48e944f_D20220618-20220618" decimals="INF" name="kprx:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesFromPanoptesHoldBackShares" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="0" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOjk2ZjljNTIyYjY1NDQ4M2E4NjA5NTViNDY3ZDQ2ZGE5L3NlYzo5NmY5YzUyMmI2NTQ0ODNhODYwOTU1YjQ2N2Q0NmRhOV80Ni9mcmFnOmU1MTNiMWIxOTdlZDQ2Yzc5YmU3ZWQ3MzRmNzg4ODgxL3RleHRyZWdpb246ZTUxM2IxYjE5N2VkNDZjNzliZTdlZDczNGY3ODg4ODFfNzQz_3f7a510c-e133-46ff-89e9-574e7add87d6">10,086</ix:nonFraction> shares of common stock to former shareholders of Panoptes, which had been held back for a period of <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="ibbe74c92762e444b8b4a11d2df320203_D20220618-20220618" name="kprx:BusinessAcquisitionHoldbackSharesTerm" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOjk2ZjljNTIyYjY1NDQ4M2E4NjA5NTViNDY3ZDQ2ZGE5L3NlYzo5NmY5YzUyMmI2NTQ0ODNhODYwOTU1YjQ2N2Q0NmRhOV80Ni9mcmFnOmU1MTNiMWIxOTdlZDQ2Yzc5YmU3ZWQ3MzRmNzg4ODgxL3RleHRyZWdpb246ZTUxM2IxYjE5N2VkNDZjNzliZTdlZDczNGY3ODg4ODFfMTA5OTUxMTYzNTIxOA_881db356-7a13-4e17-a13b-c8dfe23cc1a2">eighteen months</ix:nonNumeric> following the closing of the Panoptes acquisition to satisfy post-closing adjustment and indemnification obligations pursuant to the terms of the Share Purchase Agreement between the Company and the former shareholders of Panoptes.</span></div><div style="margin-top:12pt;text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">On July 22, 2022, the Company entered into an underwriting agreement to issue and sell stock and warrants in a public offering (the &#8220;Public Offering&#8221;). On July 25, 2022, the underwriter fully exercised the option granted by the Company to purchase stock and warrants (the &#8220;Option&#8221;). On July&#160;26, 2022, the Public Offering closed, and the Company issued and sold (i) <ix:nonFraction unitRef="shares" contextRef="i1b66dcd368fe43bb935e95e6847db746_D20220726-20220726" decimals="INF" name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesNewIssues" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="0" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOjk2ZjljNTIyYjY1NDQ4M2E4NjA5NTViNDY3ZDQ2ZGE5L3NlYzo5NmY5YzUyMmI2NTQ0ODNhODYwOTU1YjQ2N2Q0NmRhOV80Ni9mcmFnOmU1MTNiMWIxOTdlZDQ2Yzc5YmU3ZWQ3MzRmNzg4ODgxL3RleHRyZWdpb246ZTUxM2IxYjE5N2VkNDZjNzliZTdlZDczNGY3ODg4ODFfMTQ0OA_98cbf554-1800-4a8f-b2a3-2343212293d2">592,392</ix:nonFraction> shares of common stock (the &#8220;Common Shares&#8221;) (including <ix:nonFraction unitRef="shares" contextRef="ia26341c2e45a4c0b8a69d02f4162d79d_I20220726" decimals="INF" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightNumberOfSecuritiesCalledByWarrantsOrRights" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="0" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOjk2ZjljNTIyYjY1NDQ4M2E4NjA5NTViNDY3ZDQ2ZGE5L3NlYzo5NmY5YzUyMmI2NTQ0ODNhODYwOTU1YjQ2N2Q0NmRhOV80Ni9mcmFnOmU1MTNiMWIxOTdlZDQ2Yzc5YmU3ZWQ3MzRmNzg4ODgxL3RleHRyZWdpb246ZTUxM2IxYjE5N2VkNDZjNzliZTdlZDczNGY3ODg4ODFfMTUwNw_8d370500-87d0-40e0-9586-87bd00991c5f">98,138</ix:nonFraction> Common Shares sold pursuant to the exercise of the Option), (ii) <ix:nonFraction unitRef="shares" contextRef="i428ffde5c12f47e6b2fea28ff82c3b95_I20220726" decimals="INF" name="us-gaap:ConvertiblePreferredStockSharesIssuedUponConversion" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="0" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOjk2ZjljNTIyYjY1NDQ4M2E4NjA5NTViNDY3ZDQ2ZGE5L3NlYzo5NmY5YzUyMmI2NTQ0ODNhODYwOTU1YjQ2N2Q0NmRhOV80Ni9mcmFnOmU1MTNiMWIxOTdlZDQ2Yzc5YmU3ZWQ3MzRmNzg4ODgxL3RleHRyZWdpb246ZTU