onFraction unitRef="usdPerShare" contextRef="i1ff209e75e31496287fdbc0ee3024a3d_I20220726" decimals="2" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights1" scale="0" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOjk2ZjljNTIyYjY1NDQ4M2E4NjA5NTViNDY3ZDQ2ZGE5L3NlYzo5NmY5YzUyMmI2NTQ0ODNhODYwOTU1YjQ2N2Q0NmRhOV80Ni9mcmFnOmU1MTNiMWIxOTdlZDQ2Yzc5YmU3ZWQ3MzRmNzg4ODgxL3RleHRyZWdpb246ZTUxM2IxYjE5N2VkNDZjNzliZTdlZDczNGY3ODg4ODFfMjQ0Mw_07a98f07-8a19-476b-bdb2-caf447c26e8f">8.00</ix:nonFraction>. The Class A Warrants will expire on September 23, 2023 and the Class B Warrants will expire on September 23, 2027. The exercise prices of the Warrants are subject to appropriate adjustment in the event of recapitalization events, stock dividends, stock splits, stock combinations, reclassifications, reorganizations or similar events affecting the Company&#8217;s common stock. </span></div><div style="margin-top:12pt;text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">During August 2022, all holders of the Series E Preferred Shares issued in the Public Offering, elected to convert their Series E Preferred Shares into <ix:nonFraction unitRef="shares" contextRef="i510773064e144fdf85725326ba1970db_I20220831" decimals="INF" name="us-gaap:ConvertiblePreferredStockSharesIssuedUponConversion" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="0" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOjk2ZjljNTIyYjY1NDQ4M2E4NjA5NTViNDY3ZDQ2ZGE5L3NlYzo5NmY5YzUyMmI2NTQ0ODNhODYwOTU1YjQ2N2Q0NmRhOV80Ni9mcmFnOmU1MTNiMWIxOTdlZDQ2Yzc5YmU3ZWQ3MzRmNzg4ODgxL3RleHRyZWdpb246ZTUxM2IxYjE5N2VkNDZjNzliZTdlZDczNGY3ODg4ODFfMzYzMA_2f09e983-0747-4e9a-bb6d-5dff0e0049d3">160,000</ix:nonFraction> shares of Common Stock.</span></div><div style="margin-top:12pt;text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">On November&#160;17, 2022, the Company entered into warrant exercise inducement offer letters with some of the Class A Warrant holders who agreed to exercise for cash all of their Class A Warrants to purchase <ix:nonFraction unitRef="shares" contextRef="id3f987d238664974aae8abe00bed1005_D20221117-20221117" decimals="INF" name="kprx:ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercised" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="0" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOjk2ZjljNTIyYjY1NDQ4M2E4NjA5NTViNDY3ZDQ2ZGE5L3NlYzo5NmY5YzUyMmI2NTQ0ODNhODYwOTU1YjQ2N2Q0NmRhOV80Ni9mcmFnOmU1MTNiMWIxOTdlZDQ2Yzc5YmU3ZWQ3MzRmNzg4ODgxL3RleHRyZWdpb246ZTUxM2IxYjE5N2VkNDZjNzliZTdlZDczNGY3ODg4ODFfNTQ5NzU1ODI4NDYy_ff6bbf3d-8459-41a2-a506-cf5055904f7c">654,609</ix:nonFraction> shares of common stock originally issued in the Public Offering in exchange for the Company's agreement to issue new warrants (the &#8220;Inducement Warrants&#8221;) on substantially the same terms as the Class A Warrants to purchase up to <ix:nonFraction unitRef="shares" contextRef="i56c6b7af964c40d58279b7b4b0378a87_I20221117" decimals="INF" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightNumberOfSecuritiesCalledByWarrantsOrRights" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="0" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOjk2ZjljNTIyYjY1NDQ4M2E4NjA5NTViNDY3ZDQ2ZGE5L3NlYzo5NmY5YzUyMmI2NTQ0ODNhODYwOTU1YjQ2N2Q0NmRhOV80Ni9mcmFnOmU1MTNiMWIxOTdlZDQ2Yzc5YmU3ZWQ3MzRmNzg4ODgxL3RleHRyZWdpb246ZTUxM2IxYjE5N2VkNDZjNzliZTdlZDczNGY3ODg4ODFfMTA5OTUxMTY0MjQ1OQ_e562afff-c0a4-4807-bd89-25bc2c02bd1a">654,609</ix:nonFraction> shares of Common Stock. Each Inducement Warrant is exercisable at a price per share of common stock of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usdPerShare" contextRef="i37b43eed868f48d6b2c715c11beabfda_I20221117" decimals="2" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights1" scale="0" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOjk2ZjljNTIyYjY1NDQ4M2E4NjA5NTViNDY3ZDQ2ZGE5L3NlYzo5NmY5YzUyMmI2NTQ0ODNhODYwOTU1YjQ2N2Q0NmRhOV80Ni9mcmFnOmU1MTNiMWIxOTdlZDQ2Yzc5YmU3ZWQ3MzRmNzg4ODgxL3RleHRyZWdpb246ZTUxM2IxYjE5N2VkNDZjNzliZTdlZDczNGY3ODg4ODFfNTQ5NzU1ODI4NDcw_1e9a810b-63d3-404c-83c3-7d1e1dd6b6a3">5.97</ix:nonFractio