proximately $0.1 million. The warrants have an exercise price of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usdPerShare" contextRef="idb72dac6ab984dfa911bbde3200bebec_I20230203" decimals="3" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights1" scale="0" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOjk2ZjljNTIyYjY1NDQ4M2E4NjA5NTViNDY3ZDQ2ZGE5L3NlYzo5NmY5YzUyMmI2NTQ0ODNhODYwOTU1YjQ2N2Q0NmRhOV80Ni9mcmFnOmU1MTNiMWIxOTdlZDQ2Yzc5YmU3ZWQ3MzRmNzg4ODgxL3RleHRyZWdpb246ZTUxM2IxYjE5N2VkNDZjNzliZTdlZDczNGY3ODg4ODFfNTQ5NzU1ODI4NTI0_ac134536-c86a-46cf-819b-6b977e5a4b9a">3.538</ix:nonFraction> per share, subject to adjustments as provided under the terms of the warrants, and will be exercisable on the <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="id864482112fc4f6991e378748f820fcc_D20230203-20230203" name="kprx:WarrantsExercisableAnniversaryOfClosingDatePeriod" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOjk2ZjljNTIyYjY1NDQ4M2E4NjA5NTViNDY3ZDQ2ZGE5L3NlYzo5NmY5YzUyMmI2NTQ0ODNhODYwOTU1YjQ2N2Q0NmRhOV80Ni9mcmFnOmU1MTNiMWIxOTdlZDQ2Yzc5YmU3ZWQ3MzRmNzg4ODgxL3RleHRyZWdpb246ZTUxM2IxYjE5N2VkNDZjNzliZTdlZDczNGY3ODg4ODFfMTA5OTUxMTY0NjcwOA_d6e9c9fe-8012-43ce-8455-e5811c79b954">six-month</ix:nonNumeric> anniversary of the closing date. The warrants are exercisable for <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="i105e6dc5d10147628f588d3e7f8a734c_D20230203-20230203" name="kprx:ClassOfWarrantOrRightPeriodFromIssuanceThatWarrantBecomesExercisable" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOjk2ZjljNTIyYjY1NDQ4M2E4NjA5NTViNDY3ZDQ2ZGE5L3NlYzo5NmY5YzUyMmI2NTQ0ODNhODYwOTU1YjQ2N2Q0NmRhOV80Ni9mcmFnOmU1MTNiMWIxOTdlZDQ2Yzc5YmU3ZWQ3MzRmNzg4ODgxL3RleHRyZWdpb246ZTUxM2IxYjE5N2VkNDZjNzliZTdlZDczNGY3ODg4ODFfNTQ5NzU1ODI4NTI4_4445f42f-d4ff-45ec-af16-4f38fc47e2b3">five years</ix:nonNumeric> from the issuance date.</span></div></ix:continuation><div style="height:45pt;position:relative;width:100%"><div style="bottom:0;position:absolute;width:100%"><div style="text-align:center"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-siz