of common stock (subject to certain limitations), from time to time and at the Company's sole discretion over the term of the purchase agreement. On February&#160;22, 2023, the Company completed its first issuance under this agreement for a total of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="shares" contextRef="i3879a4b93109414c98edcb5ff60b5133_D20230222-20230222" decimals="INF" name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesNewIssues" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="0" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOjk2ZjljNTIyYjY1NDQ4M2E4NjA5NTViNDY3ZDQ2ZGE5L3NlYzo5NmY5YzUyMmI2NTQ0ODNhODYwOTU1YjQ2N2Q0NmRhOV80Ni9mcmFnOmU1MTNiMWIxOTdlZDQ2Yzc5YmU3ZWQ3MzRmNzg4ODgxL3RleHRyZWdpb246ZTUxM2IxYjE5N2VkNDZjNzliZTdlZDczNGY3ODg4ODFfNTQ5NzU1ODI4NTQ4_ab588984-dac8-4eea-95b6-d0aeac0d8170">20,000</ix:nonFraction> shares sold to Lincoln Park for proceeds of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="ic054a4d6e24641559b966ee4712d2e43_D20230222-20230222" decimals="-5" name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromIssuanceOfCommonStock" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="6" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOjk2ZjljNTIyYjY1NDQ4M2E4NjA5NTViNDY3ZDQ2ZGE5L3NlYzo5NmY5YzUyMmI2NTQ0ODNhODYwOTU1YjQ2N2Q0NmRhOV80Ni9mcmFnOmU1MTNiMWIxOTdlZDQ2Yzc5YmU3ZWQ3MzRmNzg4ODgxL3RleHRyZWdpb246ZTUxM2IxYjE5N2VkNDZjNzliZTdlZDczNGY3ODg4ODFfNTQ5NzU1ODI4NTUy_96c1deae-fb5b-4f49-b95b-5ad3337daaa2">0.1</ix:nonFraction> million (Note 9).</ix:continuation></span></div><div id="i96f9c522b654483a860955b467d46da9_52"></div><div style="margin-top:12pt;text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">5. <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="i977549e4ba3e4362ae3e05327fbde31a_D20230101-20230331" name="kprx:WarrantsDisclosureTextBlock" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOjk2ZjljNTIyYjY1NDQ4M2E4NjA5NTViNDY3ZDQ2ZGE5L3NlYzo5NmY5YzUyMmI2NTQ0ODNhODYwOTU1YjQ2N2Q0NmRhOV81Mi9mcmFnOjQxNzI5Y2Q3NzZkOTQwMjBiMDRmY2Y2MTFmZDFmZDM4L3RleHRyZWdpb246NDE3MjljZDc3NmQ5NDAyMGIwNGZjZjYxMWZkMWZkMzhfMTMyOQ_9d7c369e-9ec5-49cc-9fbf-53dbb4e04e30" continued