ign:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="i48c52084df4a4ba082c48bfddd3f9f94_D20220101-20220331" decimals="0" name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardCompensationCost1" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="0" id="_11db9367-ffb5-4cdf-a1cf-4a164efa848d">215,921</ix:nonFraction>&#160;</span></td><td style="background-color:#cceeff;border-bottom:3pt double #000;border-top:1pt solid #000;padding:2px 1pt 2px 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"></td></tr></table></div></ix:nonNumeric><div style="margin-top:12pt;text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Stock Options</span></div><div style="margin-top:12pt;text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">The Company grants time-based stock options which generally vest one-third of the underlying shares on the <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="i9ecabd77c2fd475a832f914cd631b1a1_D20230101-20230331" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingPeriod1" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOjk2ZjljNTIyYjY1NDQ4M2E4NjA5NTViNDY3ZDQ2ZGE5L3NlYzo5NmY5YzUyMmI2NTQ0ODNhODYwOTU1YjQ2N2Q0NmRhOV81OC9mcmFnOjE0NzI3ZDE3ZWQ3ZTRkM2JiMWJiY2RmZGE4NzY2OWI2L3RleHRyZWdpb246MTQ3MjdkMTdlZDdlNGQzYmIxYmJjZGZkYTg3NjY5YjZfMTA5OTUxMTYzNDMxMg_72fbdd45-e325-43ac-9286-73b344ed452a">one-year</ix:nonNumeric> anniversary of the grant date and the remainder ratably over a  <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="ifee1b3d96e0f4dc3900d1d75fd0cb6ab_D20230101-20230331" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingPeriod1" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOjk2ZjljNTIyYjY1NDQ4M2E4NjA5NTViNDY3ZDQ2ZGE5L3NlYzo5NmY5YzUyMmI2NTQ0ODNhODYwOTU1YjQ2N2Q0NmRhOV81OC9mcmFnOjE0NzI3ZDE3ZWQ3ZTRkM2JiMWJiY2RmZGE4NzY2OWI2L3RleHRyZWdpb246MTQ3MjdkMTdlZDdlNGQzYmIxYmJjZGZkYTg3NjY5YjZfMTA5OTUxMTYzNDMxMw_7b79a525-1e41-4836-9ecc-1fa0e3afe135">24-month</ix:nonNumeric> period. The fair value of time-based stock options is determined using the Black-Scholes Option Pricing Model, with such value recognized as expense over the service period, which is typically <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="i2ef9cfc18db74069b5dfbff8a8a13319_D20230101-20230331" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardAwardRequisiteServicePeriod1" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOjk2ZjljNTIyYjY1NDQ4M2E4NjA5NTViNDY3ZDQ2ZGE5L3NlYzo5NmY5YzUyMmI2NTQ0ODNhODYwOTU1YjQ2N2Q0NmRhOV81OC9mcmFnOjE0NzI3ZDE3ZWQ3ZTRkM2JiMWJiY2RmZGE4NzY2OWI2L3RleHRyZWdpb246MTQ3MjdkMTdlZDdlNGQzYmIxYmJjZGZkYTg3NjY5YjZfMTA5OTUxMTYzNDMxNA_5d1e44e6-29fd-4a17-8a3c-61ba58f35c0d">three years</ix:nonNumeric>, net of actual forfeitures. <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="i977549e4ba3e4362ae3e05327fbde31a_D20230101-20230331" name="us-gaap:ScheduleOfShareBasedPaymentAwardStockOptionsValuationAssumptionsTableTextBlock" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOjk2ZjljNTIyYjY1NDQ4M2E4NjA5NTViNDY3ZDQ2ZGE5L3NlYzo5NmY5YzUyMmI2NTQ0ODNhODYwOTU1YjQ2N2Q0NmRhOV81OC9mcmFnOjE0NzI3ZDE3ZWQ3ZTRkM2JiMWJiY2RmZGE4NzY2OWI2L3RleHRyZWdpb246MTQ3MjdkMTdlZDdlNGQzYmIxYmJjZGZkYTg3NjY5YjZfMzI3Mw_7dd19621-6f51-44b2-88d2-b01f1d562c5b" continuedAt="ic1aff76c50d04817bfaa781c964768d0" escape="true">A summary of the Company&#8217;s assumptions used in determining the fair value of the stock options granted during the three months ended March&#160;31, 2023 and 2022 is shown in the following table.</ix:nonNumeric></span></div><div style="margin-top:12pt"><ix:continuation id="ic1aff76c50d04817bfaa781c964768d0"><table style="border-collapse:collapse;display:inline-table;margin-bottom:5pt;vertical-align:text-bottom;width:100.000%"><tr><td style="width:1.0%"></td><td style="width:71.930%"></td><td style="width:0.1%"></td><